			// SimpleDynel record from its row (matched by identity), re-addressed to the burst's handle + the editor
			// session playfield, and emit the DB build ONLY when it reproduces the verbatim record byte-for-byte -
			// the same zero-render-risk gate RetailLoginReplay uses; otherwise (no DB, no row, or any drift) the
			// verbatim record is sent. Proven for 17/18 props by CreateEditorSceneDynelTests; #189 item 2.
			var dynelRows = await LoadEditorSceneDynels(database);

